{{also|Fluß}}
==German==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|de|Fluß||pre-1996 orthography}}

===Etymology===
{{root|de|ine-pro|*plewd-}}
From {{inh|de|gmh|vluz}}, from {{inh|de|goh|fluz}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*fluti}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*flutiz}}, ultimately from the same root of {{m|de|fließen|t=to flow}}.

Not cognate with {{ncog|la|fluvius}}, which derives instead from {{ncog|ine-pro|*bʰlewH-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/flʊs/}}
* {{audio|de|De-Fluss.ogg|audio}}
* {{rhymes|de|ʊs|s=1}}

